          "timestamp": "2026-08-02T01:00:27.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 789
        },
        {
          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Late last year and earlier this year, AMD struck deals with Meta and OpenAI to provide them with performance-based warrants that vest based on the purchase and deployment of up to 6 GW of AMD Instinct GPUs – with vesting also dependent on AMD’s share price crossing various",
          "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2084278532729889264",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-03T22:01:40.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 364
        },
        {
          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "GREAT WORK BY  @GPU_MODE   FOR LAUNCHING THE $1.1mil AMD KERNEL HACKATHON.  The GPUMODE Readonflow Team’s kernels improved end-to-end MI355X performance by over 2x. We explain the optimizations below. 1/4",
          "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2082647404466069967",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-30T10:00:09.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 323
        },
        {
          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "If AMD’s share price rises to the $600-700 range – the capital cost for the GPUs only will effectively be zero for both! If AMD continues to make strides improving their software stack and winning large customer orders and sees their share price increase above $1,000 – then this",
          "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2084278535640830193",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-03T22:01:41.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 151
        },
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "AMD 因記憶體短缺，計畫對板卡合作夥伴（如 PowerColor、Sapphire、XFX）的 GPU 核心與顯存捆綁價格上漲約 10%。  目前 Radeon RX 9000 系列定價明顯低於同級 GeForce：RX 9070 GRE 約 549 美元、RX 9070 約 640 美元、RX 9070 XT 約 689 美元，而 RTX 5070 約 630 美元、RTX 5070 Ti 約 950",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2083765499398353217",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-02T12:03:04.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 98
        },
        {
          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "With AMD’s share price shooting up from the ~$200 range in early 2026 to around $500-600 range now, this means that Meta and OpenAI’s capital cost of ownership (assuming vesting with respect to price level is roughly linear, and that the full 6GW of capacity is deployed) has",
